[
  {
    "id": "polaroids",
    "title": "Polaroids",
    "stanzas": [
      [
        {
          "text": "polaroids",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "i hang them on my wall",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        }
      ],
      [
        {
          "text": "i look at each of them",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "and wonder",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "if i could travel through them all",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        }
      ],
      [
        {
          "text": "as if every photograph",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "were somewhere",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "i could still return to",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        }
      ],
      [
        {
          "text": "sometimes i wish",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "i could grow tired of these memories",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        }
      ],
      [
        {
          "text": "but memories always have a way",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "of coming back to me",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        }
      ],
      [
        {
          "text": "“i’ll be back soon,”",
          "italic": true,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "i said",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        }
      ],
      [
        {
          "text": "“pinky promise,”",
          "italic": true,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "i said",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        }
      ],
      [
        {
          "text": "maybe i’ll come back one day",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "maybe i won’t",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        }
      ],
      [
        {
          "text": "maybe i keep going back",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "just to live a little longer",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "in the way things used to be",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        }
      ],
      [
        {
          "text": "even when they cannot",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "come back to me.",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        }
      ]
    ],
    "source": "https://sarakim23.vercel.app/writing/poetry#polaroids"
  },
  {
    "id": "echoes-of-silence",
    "title": "Echoes of Silence",
    "stanzas": [
      [
        {
          "text": "echoes of silence were all you left me",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "my heart broke forth in tears",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "in wrathful waves you tossed me",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "and left me drowning in my own fears",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        }
      ],
      [
        {
          "text": "amidst the silence and all that went unspoken",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "i was left to endure an isolation so profound",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "that in my solitude i dreamt of imaginary worlds",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "wherein i ran towards the very edges of the earth",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "but there was no such edge and so i ran and ran without end",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "the grass beneath my feet pulled me under like a rug drawn from beneath me",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "for the cruel amusement of watching me stumble and fall",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        }
      ],
      [
        {
          "text": "soon enough i came upon the sea",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "where running was no longer possible",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "my feet dragged against the earth as though gravity itself had conspired to hold me back",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "no matter how fiercely i willed myself onward",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "i could not run as fast as my mind wished to flee",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "for my thoughts were turbulent and my mind so overcome with melancholy",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "that the farther i ran the more rage and rapture consumed me",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "so i ran with such fury that i rose against the unforgiving waves and",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "into the teeth of the gale",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "and ran for the stars",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        }
      ],
      [
        {
          "text": "there i stumbled upon the strange sorrow of olbers' paradox",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "and wondered how a heaven so full of stars could leave me in such darkness",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "for all the light i had once known was lost in eternal slumber",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "as every star had long since perished and all that remained was the memory of its light",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "and there was no warmth to be found amongst them",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        }
      ],
      [
        {
          "text": "so i succumbed to a misery greater still as my fingers grew cold and frostbitten",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "blue purple grey and white my body turned until i could move no longer",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "my knees buckled and cracked beneath the terrible cold of the milky way",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "and though all of this had passed in but a few fleeting moments",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "it seemed as though i had endured centuries upon centuries of",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "agony and anger and melancholy",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "and before the frost could reach my eyes",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "before the last glimmer of light deserted me in that vast darkness as i drifted into the abyss",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "i shed one final bitter tear and",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "sent it wandering into the dark towards whomever might still care",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "for my mind my heart my soul",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        }
      ],
      [
        {
          "text": "for these were the echoes of silence in which you left me",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "and if you had cared you would not have left me so",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "if you had cared you would have asked me why",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "why my heart broke forth in tears and",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "why you stood in silence as i succumbed to all my fears",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "why you left me to wander through worlds of my own making in search of an end that did not exist",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "why i ran until my feet could carry me no farther and still found no refuge from the thoughts that pursued me",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        }
      ],
      [
        {
          "text": "and so in echoes of silence i shall remain",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "not in words but in heart",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "with this hollow place where something once lived",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "and all the sorrow that has since come to dwell within it",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        }
      ],
      [
        {
          "text": "for after all the worlds i have wandered and all the distances i have run",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "all i ever wished was for you to understand",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "where you had left me only echoes of silence",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "the sorrow i had carried in your silence.",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        }
      ]
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "i-miss",
    "title": "I miss",
    "stanzas": [
      [
        {
          "text": "i miss the sunsets",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "when the clouds appeared their prettiest",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "warm colours bleeding into one another",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "how they gave me emotions",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "and memories of a home",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        }
      ],
      [
        {
          "text": "i miss the smell",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "of honey and lavender",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "on walks with my sister",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "past the houses of neighbours",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "whose streets i still remember",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        }
      ],
      [
        {
          "text": "i miss walking home from school",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "with the friends i loved most",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "and the one friend",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "who carried all the things",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "i was too afraid",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "to carry alone",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        }
      ],
      [
        {
          "text": "i miss the friends i made",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "just before leaving",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "how cruel it was",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "a hello could arrive late,",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "with goodbye already",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "waiting at the door",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        }
      ],
      [
        {
          "text": "i miss how slowly the days passed",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "how quickly the years went by",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        }
      ],
      [
        {
          "text": "i miss the times i had them all,",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        }
      ],
      [
        {
          "text": "i miss.",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        }
      ]
    ],
    "source": "https://sarakim23.vercel.app/writing/poetry#i-miss",
    "sourceImage": {
      "src": "/images/poetry/i-miss.jpeg",
      "alt": "Clouds over a quiet intersection at sunset."
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "the-stars-do-not-know",
    "title": "The stars do not know",
    "stanzas": [
      [
        {
          "text": "we’ve heard about the stars.",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "we’ve even named them.",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        }
      ],
      [
        {
          "text": "but the stars don’t know us—",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "they don’t know me.",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "they don’t even know my name.",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        }
      ],
      [
        {
          "text": "i guess then, that means",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "i cannot exist without the stars,",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "but the stars continue to exist",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "without me.",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        }
      ]
    ],
    "source": "https://sarakim23.vercel.app/writing/poetry#the-stars-do-not-know"
  },
  {
    "id": "i-wandered-through-the-sea",
    "title": "I Wandered Through the Sea",
    "stanzas": [
      [
        {
          "text": "I wandered through the sea,",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "the sun waylaying",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "at the edge of the world,",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "as it said goodnight",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "and laid its head to sleep.",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        }
      ],
      [
        {
          "text": "I journeyed through the waves",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "as the moon lit up the path,",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "as if it knew",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "the voyage I had taken on,",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "and where I’d be drawn",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        }
      ],
      [
        {
          "text": "With fragments of the sun",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "so gently borrowed,",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "half her face, innocent",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "and almost sly,",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "hid behind",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "the blue earth’s shadow",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        }
      ],
      [
        {
          "text": "I glimmered through the waters,",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "as though I moved in quiet accord",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "from dear Titan Selene",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "for meek and gentle tides.",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        }
      ],
      [
        {
          "text": "Soon I became unaware",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "of the path I was taking,",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "lost in that monochrome",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "of blue, grey, and black",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        }
      ],
      [
        {
          "text": "Slowly, I was taken in",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "by the beauty",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "of those vast blue sheets,",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "by the glimmers of moonlight",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "and the stars that danced",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "on the sharp crests of the waves",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        }
      ],
      [
        {
          "text": "I wandered through the sea",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "until I had gone so far",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "that I became a tiny creature",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "meaningless,",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "yet somehow meaningful",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        }
      ],
      [
        {
          "text": "held among the rise and fall",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "of waves in their obedience",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "to the moon.",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        }
      ]
    ],
    "source": "https://sarakim23.vercel.app/writing/poetry#i-wandered-through-the-sea",
    "artwork": {
      "src": "/art/i-wandered-through-the-sea-spread.webp",
      "alt": "A small sailboat crossing moonlit blue waves beneath a star-filled sky."
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "the-space-between-us",
    "title": "The Space Between Us",
    "stanzas": [
      [
        {
          "text": "returning to a home",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "distant yet so close",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        }
      ],
      [
        {
          "text": "seeing you",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "is like viewing planets through a telescope",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        }
      ],
      [
        {
          "text": "maybe through all this chaos and confusion",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "brought down to us",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "on this tiny",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        }
      ],
      [
        {
          "text": "pale",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "blue",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "dot",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        }
      ],
      [
        {
          "text": "suspended in a sunbeam",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        }
      ],
      [
        {
          "text": "we can overcome many things,",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "travel through planets",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "and whatever lies beyond",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        }
      ],
      [
        {
          "text": "as I gaze upon billions of years",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "of collapsing and re-emerging stars",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        }
      ],
      [
        {
          "text": "I will find peace and serenity",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "in your eyes",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        }
      ],
      [
        {
          "text": "concentrated in you.",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        }
      ]
    ],
    "source": "https://sarakim23.vercel.app/writing/poetry#the-space-between-us",
    "sourceImage": {
      "src": "/images/poetry/the-space-between-us-moon.png",
      "alt": "A crescent moon over a waterfront at dusk."
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "blue-bird",
    "title": "blue bird",
    "stanzas": [
      [
        {
          "text": "i walk a lonely path in autumn's chill",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "as my heart weeps in despair",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        }
      ],
      [
        {
          "text": "i look for his collar amongst the flock",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "but he is nowhere there.",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        }
      ],
      [
        {
          "text": "where has my best friend gone?",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "have you seen him,",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "is he there?",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        }
      ],
      [
        {
          "text": "he is but a little ear of sweet corn,",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "his cheeks as blue as the noonday sky,",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "his feathers soft as fallen snow.",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        }
      ],
      [
        {
          "text": "each morning i would idly sit",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "and await my little blue bird,",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "who came to sing his morning song,",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "a tender tune of good morrow.",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        }
      ],
      [
        {
          "text": "but my blue bird no longer comes",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "to serenade me sweet hues",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "and i am left alone",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "to seek solace of my own,",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 1
        },
        {
          "text": "my own glimmer of hope",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 2
        },
        {
          "text": "my own hand to hold.",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 3
        }
      ],
      [
        {
          "text": "lately, each sundown",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "the wind grows ever harshly",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 2
        },
        {
          "text": "the fading gold brushes my cheeks",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 1
        },
        {
          "text": "to belittle me of another day's end",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 1
        },
        {
          "text": "and the jays still sing their tune",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "but i do not listen,",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 1
        },
        {
          "text": "for it is not for me.",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 1
        }
      ],
      [
        {
          "text": "every twilight by bedside, i pray",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "whilst looking from the windowsill",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 1
        },
        {
          "text": "if not today, perhaps tomorrow",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 2
        },
        {
          "text": "for my blue bird to come by",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 2
        },
        {
          "text": "every sunrise i wake in aching despair",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "to hear no longer the sweet, serenading chirps",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 1
        },
        {
          "text": "for where his morning song once dwelt.",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 1
        }
      ],
      [
        {
          "text": "still i send my thoughts to him,",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "my little blue bird",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "wherever he may roam,",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "that the winds be gentle on his wings,",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "and the autumn cold not reach his bones",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        }
      ],
      [
        {
          "text": "for my heart goes out to him,",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "with the tender hope",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "for my blue bird to one day",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "return home.",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        }
      ]
    ],
    "date": "Nov 10, 2026"
  },
  {
    "id": "september",
    "title": "September",
    "stanzas": [
      [
        {
          "text": "Across the meadow of overgrown weeds,",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "a radiant willow",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "spread her shade about my feet.",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        }
      ],
      [
        {
          "text": "So I sat down",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "beneath the weeping dress of her leaves,",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "where branches loosened into locks",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "of yellow, amber, gold,",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        }
      ],
      [
        {
          "text": "“Who planted thee?”",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "I asked.",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "She answered only whispers,",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "letting down her hair",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "to sway beneath the wind’s light tickle.",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        }
      ],
      [
        {
          "text": "Thus, by chance,",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "I came to sit beside this willow,",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "enamoured of her golden hues",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "in the lingering warmth",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "and quiet mists of autumn",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        }
      ],
      [
        {
          "text": "Here I shall read many books, write essays,",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "and linger over art, philosophy, poetry,",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "for as long as she gives me shade",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "and sings to me",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "with the rustling of her leaves.",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        }
      ],
      [
        {
          "text": "Beneath her branches,",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "I shall watch the seasons turn,",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "and come to know",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "each new-grown twig,",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "each bough that reaches",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "further than before.",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        }
      ]
    ],
    "date": "Nov 2, 2026",
    "artwork": {
      "src": "/art/september-autumn.webp",
      "alt": "A woman sits beneath a leafy willow beside a turquoise lake."
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "june",
    "title": "June",
    "stanzas": [
      [
        {
          "text": "An oak may spend a hundred years",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "unfolding towards the sun,",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "and cradle in its acorns",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "the forests yet to come.",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        }
      ],
      [
        {
          "text": "Yet in the year I’ve known you,",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "I have watched those centuries unfold",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "new branches reaching outwards,",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "new roots that take their hold.",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        }
      ],
      [
        {
          "text": "This day marks new beginnings,",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "and we have yet to grow,",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "each year I promise",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "to visit you in your meadow,",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "to marvel at the acorns",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "your boughs that've come to bear,",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "and weep upon the morrow",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "when I must leave you there.",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        }
      ],
      [
        {
          "text": "For I would move my roots",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "so we might come to share",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "one great canopy,",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "our branches woven there,",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        }
      ],
      [
        {
          "text": "and I would send my clouds to you",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "to shade your summer hours,",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "to keep your meadow verdurous",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "with soft and passing showers.",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        }
      ],
      [
        {
          "text": "For home is not the place",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "wherein your first buds broke,",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "but where your branches grow",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        }
      ],
      [
        {
          "text": "and should our leaves",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "touch again some distant June,",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "may you feel at home",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        }
      ],
      [
        {
          "text": "beneath them,",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "as I have",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "beneath yours.",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        }
      ]
    ],
    "date": "Nov 1, 2026"
  },
  {
    "id": "the-friend-i-tamed",
    "title": "The Friend I Tamed",
    "stanzas": [
      [
        {
          "text": "The Vale was green before we met,",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "The fern was wet with dew",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "I knew the names of lead and bough,",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "And passed, as strangers do.",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        }
      ],
      [
        {
          "text": "Then upon the sylvan lea,",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "A fox sat in the shade",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "I greeted him beneath the boughs",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "That sheltered half the glade.",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        }
      ],
      [
        {
          "text": "\"I am quite lonely,\" said the fox,",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "And turned his face to me",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "\"I too am lonely,\" I confessed,",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "\"as thou, perhaps, canst see.\"",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        }
      ],
      [
        {
          "text": "\"How must one tame a friend?\"",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "I asked.",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "\"You risk tears,\"",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "The fox replied,",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "\"If you let yourself be tamed.\"",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        }
      ],
      [
        {
          "text": "Thus we began",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "To wander through hidden leas,",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "Roamed the dells till night",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "What had been an empty vale",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "Grew dear in failing light.",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        }
      ],
      [
        {
          "text": "When the day drew near",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "In honeydew the sun lay",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "We wept beneath the tree",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "Yet all the days before",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "Were his greatest gift to me.",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        }
      ],
      [
        {
          "text": "When I cross the heath alone",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "The fox's tree I seek,",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "I sit a little in its shade",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "To listen for thy feet",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        }
      ],
      [
        {
          "text": "To others, only russet fur,",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "A creature passing by",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "To me, a hundred evenings spent",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "Beneath the selfsame sky.",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        }
      ]
    ],
    "date": "Oct 26, 2026"
  }
]
